# Externally delivered model trains.
#
# These folders are delivered by project partners and kept byte-for-byte as
# received, including their own READMEs.
#
# `-text` disables git's end-of-line conversion for them: without it,
# `core.autocrlf` normalises CRLF to LF on commit and back on checkout, so a
# Linux clone would see different bytes than were delivered. That matters for
# fixed-format model input parsed by column position (the HYDRUS-1D project
# files ATMOSPH.IN, PROFILE.DAT, SELECTOR.IN, …) and for reproducing a partner's
# delivery exactly.
#
# `linguist-vendored` keeps them out of GitHub's language statistics, so a third
# party's code does not describe this repository.
#
# The matching tooling exclusions live in .pre-commit-config.yaml and
# .markdownlint-cli2.jsonc; neither folder is in the CI matrices in
# .github/workflows/{ci,security}.yml.
model-trains/1D-HYDRUS-PHREEQC-MODFLOW2005-MT3D/** -text linguist-vendored
model-trains/MODFLOW6-reservoir-model/**         -text linguist-vendored
